/*  A function makes its parameter name a new series, then returns it.
    Obligation broken: O1, what is read must not be deeper than the checker thinks. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.
    Found 2026-11-19 by docs/soundness/model/against_cufet.py (seed 11): all 26 programs it found share this shape.  */

Bind series of number to fresh, given (the series of number s):
    s becomes a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    Return s.
Done.
Define outer as a series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    outer becomes cast fresh on (outer).
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State outer.
